# on_click
{~Test me, I dare you.|I make my own luck.|No gods. Only man.|They won't know what hit 'em.|Come at me already!}

# on_absorb
{~Haha!|Thanks!|What did you expect?|I'll use this!|Your power is mine!}

# on_firecast
{~How's this for might?|Perun abandoned you!|I'll reduce YOU to cinders!|YOU burn!}

# on_windcast
{~What comes around goes around!|YOU move!|They're my spirits now!|Can YOU run like the wind?}

# on_failcast
{~Huh?|What?|It's not working!|Something's wrong...|It's...broken?}
    -> END
